        "heading_BcjGbj": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>For Québec consumers only – Notice concerning the guarantee of availability of spare parts, repair services, and information necessary for maintenance or repair (s. 39 of the Consumer Protection Act)</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_hcRU8F": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Please note that StoreBound LLC (hereinafter referred to as “Dash”), together with its affiliates, subsidiaries, parent companies, insurers, successors, and assigns, does not guarantee, within the meaning of section 39 of the Consumer Protection Act, CQLR, c. P-40.1, and sections 79.18 to 79.20 of the Regulation respecting the application of the Consumer Protection Act, CQLR, c. P-40.1, r. 3, the availability of spare parts, repair services, or the information necessary for the maintenance or repair of goods manufactured, imported, advertised, or sold by Dash or its affiliates.</p><p>That said, depending on the product type and brand, we continue to offer options such as repair service, product exchange, and/or spare parts, subject to the terms of the manufacturer’s limited warranty.</p><p>For more details about your specific product, please visit our <a href=\"https://bydash.com/collections/support\" title=\"https://bydash.com/collections/support\">Support Page</a> or contact our Customer Support team at <strong>1-800-898-6970</strong>.</p>"
          }
